To be clear, i have to use a modeline to get 1280x720 in xorg.conf
Without it ,tv stay at 1024x768 60hz.

with the nvidia it was  the same :
put a modeline and  use this:
Option "ModeValidation" "AllowNon60HzDFPModes , NoEdidMaxPClkCheck ,
